<body>

<header>
    <h1>🏥 Rural Healthcare Access Solution</h1>
    <p>Nabha & Surrounding Rural Areas</p>
</header>

<section>
    <h2>📌 Problem Overview</h2>
    <p>
        Nabha Civil Hospital operates at less than 50% capacity with only 11 doctors out of 23 sanctioned posts.
        Patients from 173 villages travel long distances, often losing wages, only to find unavailable specialists
        or medicine shortages. Poor infrastructure further worsens access.
    </p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>🎯 Objective</h2>
    <p>
        To build a scalable, low-bandwidth healthcare solution that improves access to medical services
        for rural communities through digital innovation.
    </p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>🚀 Proposed Solution</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><b>Multilingual Telemedicine App:</b> Video/audio consultations with doctors</li>
        <li><b>Offline Health Records:</b> Accessible anytime with sync support</li>
        <li><b>Medicine Availability Tracker:</b> Real-time updates from pharmacies</li>
        <li><b>AI Symptom Checker:</b> Quick health guidance in low-bandwidth areas</li>
        <li><b>Scalable System:</b> Expandable to other rural regions</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>💡 Impact</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Reduced unnecessary travel</li>
        <li>Improved healthcare access</li>
        <li>Less financial burden on workers</li>
        <li>Better health outcomes</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>👥 Stakeholders</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Rural patients</li>
        <li>Civil Hospital staff</li>
        <li>Punjab Health Department</li>
        <li>Local pharmacies</li>
        <li>Farmers & daily-wage workers</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>📊 Supporting Data</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>11 out of 23 doctor positions filled</li>
        <li>Only 31% rural households have internet access</li>
        <li>Telemedicine growing at 31% CAGR in India</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>🛠️ Tech Stack</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Frontend: React / Flutter</li>
        <li>Backend: Node.js / Django</li>
        <li>Database: MongoDB / Firebase</li>
        <li>AI: Python (ML models)</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>🔮 Future Enhancements</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Government scheme integration</li>
        <li>SMS alerts for non-smartphone users</li>
        <li>Voice-based assistance</li>
        <li>Ambulance tracking</li>
    </ul>
</section>

